{"4817240": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Transcendent", "steam_appid": 4817240, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4821600], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Last Transcendent</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight as a Transcendent, a powerful warrior blessed by the gods with incredible power. 15 years after all the Transcendents were wiped out, awaken in a mysterious crystal, and battle your way to the capital to discover your dark past and fight for your future, and the future of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4817240/extras/4eddf63924cec65879c6becda3a65fe4.avif?t=1786032842\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4817240/extras_big/4eddf63924cec65879c6becda3a65fe4.webp?t=1786032842 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hack and Slash</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your divine sword to hack and slash multiple waves of enemies and bosses. Upgrade your health, stamina, and spark as you progress through Thalos to get to the capital. Unlock many lightning abilities to deal massive damage to groups of enemies, and use your lightning bolt to stun enemies before taking them down.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4817240/extras/e825b13c272d1da47dd16bc1da8e739a.avif?t=1786032842\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4817240/extras_big/e825b13c272d1da47dd16bc1da8e739a.webp?t=1786032842 width=1560 height=878 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4817240/extras/2288ef40480b8d0f788144ad882fa48f.avif?t=1786032842\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4817240/extras_big/2288ef40480b8d0f788144ad882fa48f.webp?t=1786032842 width=1560 height=878 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4817240/extras/225302794aae75fb936ac309242a0f06.avif?t=1786032842\" width=1271 height=715 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Looming Darkness</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the guidance of a cloaked figure to journey to the capital and discover a looming darkness that threatens to engulf all of Thalos. Forge your sword in the forge city of Fornax. Defend the city of Rostrum from a group of dark magic users known as the Magari. Defeat the looming darkness in the name of the gods.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4817240/extras/2dfa7e7ba4c5fd997e545c53f43b88a4.avif?t=1786032842\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4817240/extras_big/2dfa7e7ba4c5fd997e545c53f43b88a4.webp?t=1786032842 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Last Transcendent</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight as a Transcendent, a powerful warrior blessed by the gods with incredible power. 15 years after all the Transcendents were wiped out, awaken in a mysterious crystal, and battle your way to the capital to discover your dark past and fight for your future, and the future of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4817240/extras/4eddf63924cec65879c6becda3a65fe4.avif?t=1786032842\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4817240/extras_big/4eddf63924cec65879c6becda3a65fe4.webp?t=1786032842 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hack and Slash</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your divine sword to hack and slash multiple waves of enemies and bosses. Upgrade your health, stamina, and spark as you progress through Thalos to get to the capital. Unlock many lightning abilities to deal massive damage to groups of enemies, and use your lightning bolt to stun enemies before taking them down.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4817240/extras/e825b13c272d1da47dd16bc1da8e739a.avif?t=1786032842\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4817240/extras_big/e825b13c272d1da47dd16bc1da8e739a.webp?t=1786032842 width=1560 height=878 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4817240/extras/2288ef40480b8d0f788144ad882fa48f.avif?t=1786032842\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4817240/extras_big/2288ef40480b8d0f788144ad882fa48f.webp?t=1786032842 width=1560 height=878 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4817240/extras/225302794aae75fb936ac309242a0f06.avif?t=1786032842\" width=1271 height=715 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Looming Darkness</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the guidance of a cloaked figure to journey to the capital and discover a looming darkness that threatens to engulf all of Thalos. Forge your sword in the forge city of Fornax. Defend the city of Rostrum from a group of dark magic users known as the Magari. Defeat the looming darkness in the name of the gods.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4817240/extras/2dfa7e7ba4c5fd997e545c53f43b88a4.avif?t=1786032842\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4817240/extras_big/2dfa7e7ba4c5fd997e545c53f43b88a4.webp?t=1786032842 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Fight as Fulmus, the last Transcendent. After escaping from a crystal deep within the ground, embark on a journey to save Thalos from a looming darkness. Hack and slash with your divine sword and use your transcendent powers to unlock various lightning attacks to take down and stun enemies.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4817240/ebf170087b5bb1ea37bfc81381ee994b0fbc537f/header.jpg?t=1786032842", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4817240/213a1d80b5c91be8bcb3f22ab30ff599c521df54/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786032842", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4817240/213a1d80b5c91be8bcb3f22ab30ff599c521df54/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786032842", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 560 Ti (1GB)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GT 710<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> MacOS 12 Monterey<br></li><li><strong>Proces